# Nested Columns Demo

This document demonstrates top-level columns (using Section Breaks) and nested columns (using Tables).

@columns 2 gap=0.5in separator
  ## Left Column (Top Level)
  This text is in the left column. It uses a native Word section break.
  @table
    [**Nested Layout inside Box** (Box continues...)]
  ## Right Column (Top Level)
  This text is in the right column.
  @table
    [1. One, 3. Three, 2. Two]
@end

Back to single column.